      <!-- Privacy Policy Section -->
      <section
        id="privacy-section"
        class="hidden py-20 px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto min-h-screen scroll-section opacity-0 translate-y-8 transition-all duration-700 ease-out"
      >
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-8">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <div
          class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400"
        >
          <p class="mb-4">Last updated: July 28, 2026</p>
          <h2
            class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4"
          >
            1. Information We Collect
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            At CampusConnect, we collect information you provide directly to us,
            such as when you create an account, verify your student status, or
            communicate with other users. This includes your name, university
            email, university, state, and profile images.
          </p>

          <h2
            class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4"
          >
            2. How We Use Your Information
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            We use the information we collect to operate, maintain, and improve
            our platform. This includes verifying your student status through AI
            forensics, connecting you with local service providers or clients,
            and maintaining a secure environment for all users.
          </p>

          <h2
            class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4"
          >
            3. Data Security
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            We take reasonable measures to help protect information about you
            from loss, theft, misuse, and unauthorized access, disclosure,
            alteration, and destruction. However, please understand that no
            security system is impenetrable.
          </p>

          <h2
            class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4"
          >
            4. Sharing of Information
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            We do not share your personal information with third parties except
            as necessary to provide our services (such as displaying your
            provider profile to other students) or as required by law.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Terms of Service Section -->
      <section
        id="terms-section"
        class="hidden py-20 px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto min-h-screen scroll-section opacity-0 translate-y-8 transition-all duration-700 ease-out"
      >
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-8">
          Terms of Service
        </h1>
        <div
          class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400"
        >
          <p class="mb-4">Last updated: July 28, 2026</p>
          <h2
            class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4"
          >
            1. Acceptance of Terms
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            By accessing and using CampusConnect, you agree to be bound by these
            Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not
            use our platform.
          </p>

          <h2
            class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4"
          >
            2. Eligibility
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            You must be a currently enrolled student at a recognized university
            to use our platform. You agree to provide accurate information
            during the verification process.
          </p>

          <h2
            class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4"
          >
            3. User Conduct
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            You agree to use the platform for lawful purposes only and to
            interact with other users respectfully. CampusConnect reserves the
            right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate our community
            guidelines or engage in fraudulent activities.
          </p>

          <h2
            class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4"
          >
            4. Transactions and Services
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            CampusConnect acts as a directory and connection platform. We do not
            process payments or guarantee the quality of services provided by
            users. Any agreements or transactions made through WhatsApp or other
            channels are solely between the users involved.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
